OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,6,Ffrequent showers, some heavy
OL,7,Fespecially in the Trossachs. A few
OL,8,Fsunny intervals the best along the
OL,9,FAngus coast. A very windy day too with
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly gales, gradually easing
OL,11,Fin the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOccasional showers will
OL,14,Fcontinue across western areas
OL,15,Fespecially, with a few also reaching
OL,16,Fthe east coast, though the best of the
OL,17,Fclear spells will be here. Winds
OL,18,Feasing further.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
