OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,6,Fand a few showers mainly in the west.
OL,7,FLess windy and a little milder too.
OL,8,
OL,9,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,10,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,11,Fquite cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,12,FSome sunshine around too. A dry start
OL,13,FFriday then rain spreading from west.
OL,14,FRain easing later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
